{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，处理个人信息应当遵循哪些基本原则？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》的规定，处理个人信息应当遵循以下基本原则：\n\n1. **合法、正当、必要和诚信原则**：不得通过误导、欺诈、胁迫等方式处理个人信息（第五条）。\n2. **明确、合理的目的原则**：处理个人信息应当具有明确、合理的目的，并应当与处理目的直接相关，采取对个人权益影响最小的方式（第六条）。\n3. **公开、透明原则**：公开个人信息处理规则，明示处理的目的、方式和范围（第七条）。\n4. **保证个人信息质量原则**：避免因个人信息不准确、不完整对个人权益造成不利影响（第八条）。\n5. **不得危害国家安全、公共利益原则**：不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动（相关条款）。", "latency_ms": 2960, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "个人信息保护法对收集个人信息的范围有什么限制？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》的规定，对收集个人信息的范围主要有以下限制：\n\n1. **最小必要原则**：收集个人信息应当限于实现处理目的的最小范围，不得过度收集个人信息。\n2. **目的限制**：所收集的个人图像、身份识别信息只能用于维护公共安全的目的，不得用于其他目的。\n3. **禁止危害国家安全和公共利益**：不得从事危害国家安全、公共利益的个人信息处理活动。\n4. **提供产品/服务所必需的除外**：处理个人信息属于提供产品或者服务所必需的，属于上述限制的例外情形。\n5. **未经同意不得向他人提供**：未经被收集者同意，不得向他人提供个人信息。\n6. **禁止非法收集**：任何组织、个人不得非法收集、使用、加工、传输他人个人信息。\n\n简言之，收集个人信息须遵循“最小必要”原则，且不得超出维护公共安全等特定目的，同时禁止非法收集和未经同意的对外提供。", "latency_ms": 2805, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第六条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "无端拒答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "dsl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "数据安全法要求数据处理者建立什么制度来保障数据安全？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》的要求，数据处理者应当建立健全**全流程数据安全管理制度**，并组织开展数据安全教育培训，采取相应的技术措施和其他必要措施，保障数据安全。", "latency_ms": 2047, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.5, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 2 位（MRR=0.50）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "dsl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "数据安全法规定，发现数据安全缺陷、漏洞等风险时应当怎么做？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》第二十九条，开展数据处理活动应当加强风险监测，发现数据安全缺陷、漏洞等风险时，**应当立即采取补救措施**；如果发现其网络产品、服务存在安全缺陷、漏洞等风险，还应当**按照规定及时告知用户并向有关主管部门报告**。", "latency_ms": 2660, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-001", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "网络安全法规定国家实行什么制度来保护网络安全？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国网络安全法》第二十一条规定，国家实行**网络安全等级保护制度**来保护网络安全。", "latency_ms": 2165, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-002", "category": "direct_extraction", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "网络安全法要求网络日志至少留存多长时间？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》的规定，网络日志至少留存**六个月**。", "latency_ms": 1618, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第二十一条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法第13条规定，个人信息处理者在哪些情形下才可以处理个人信息？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第13条，个人信息处理者只有在符合下列情形之一时，方可处理个人信息：\n\n1. **取得个人的同意**；\n2. 为订立、履行个人作为一方当事人的合同所必需，或者按照依法制定的劳动规章制度和依法签订的集体合同实施人力资源管理所必需；\n3. 为履行法定职责或者法定义务所必需；\n4. 为应对突发公共卫生事件，或者紧急情况下为保护自然人的生命健康和财产安全所必需；\n5. 为公共利益实施新闻报道、舆论监督等行为，在合理的范围内处理个人信息；\n6. 依照本法规定在合理的范围内处理个人自行公开或者其他已经合法公开的个人信息；\n7. 法律、行政法规规定的其他情形。\n\n此外，依照本法其他有关规定，处理个人信息应当取得个人同意，但是有前述第2项至第7项规定情形的，不需取得个人同意。", "latency_ms": 2601, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-004", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法如何界定敏感个人信息，处理它需要满足什么条件？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国个人信息保护法》的规定，敏感个人信息的界定和处理条件如下：\n\n**一、敏感个人信息的界定**\n\n敏感个人信息是一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害或者人身、财产安全受到危害的个人信息。具体包括：\n- 生物识别信息\n- 宗教信仰信息\n- 特定身份信息\n- 医疗健康信息\n- 金融账户信息\n- 行踪轨迹信息\n- 不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息\n\n**二、处理敏感个人信息需要满足的条件**\n\n1. **特定目的和充分必要性**：只有在具有特定的目的和充分的必要性，并采取严格保护措施的情形下，方可处理敏感个人信息。\n\n2. **取得单独同意**：处理敏感个人信息应当取得个人的单独同意；法律、行政法规规定应当取得书面同意的，从其规定。\n\n3. **告知义务**：除一般告知事项外，还应当向个人告知处理敏感个人信息的必要性以及对个人权益的影响。\n\n4. **事前影响评估**：应当事前进行个人信息保护影响评估，并对处理情况进行记录。\n\n5. **遵守特别规定**：法律、行政法规对处理敏感个人信息规定应当取得相关行政许可或者作出其他限制的，从其规定。\n\n6. **制定专门规则**：针对处理敏感个人信息，制定专门的个人信息保护规则、标准。\n\n此外，处理个人信息属于提供产品或者服务所必需的除外。", "latency_ms": 3066, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.5, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 2 位（MRR=0.50）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 3/3"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "dsl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "数据安全法对重要数据的处理者规定了哪些额外的安全义务？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》的相关规定，重要数据的处理者除履行一般数据安全保护义务外，还应当承担以下额外的安全义务：\n\n1. **明确数据安全负责人和管理机构**：重要数据的处理者应当明确数据安全负责人和管理机构，落实数据安全保护责任。\n\n2. **定期开展风险评估并报送报告**：重要数据的处理者应当按照规定对其数据处理活动定期开展风险评估，并向有关主管部门报送风险评估报告（第三十条）。\n\n此外，关键信息基础设施的运营者（在适用第二十一条规定的基础上）还应当履行更严格的安全保护义务，包括设置专门安全管理机构和安全管理负责人，并对该负责人和关键岗位的人员进行安全背景审查（第三十四条）。利用互联网等信息网络开展数据处理活动的，还应当在网络安全等级保护制度的基础上履行上述数据安全保护义务。", "latency_ms": 3285, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.2, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 5 位（MRR=0.20）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-003", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "网络安全法对关键信息基础设施运营者收集产生的个人信息和重要数据有什么存储要求？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》的规定，关键信息基础设施运营者收集产生的个人信息和重要数据，**应当在境内存储**。\n\n具体而言：\n\n1. **个人信息和重要数据境内存储**：第三十七条明确，关键信息基础设施的运营者在中华人民共和国境内运营中收集和产生的个人信息和重要数据，应当在境内存储。\n\n2. **处理个人信息达到规定数量亦须境内存储**：第四十条进一步规定，关键信息基础设施运营者和处理个人信息达到国家网信部门规定数量的个人信息处理者，应当将在中华人民共和国境内收集和产生的个人信息存储在境内。\n\n3. **重要数据出境安全管理**：第三十一条指出，关键信息基础设施的运营者在境内运营中收集和产生的重要数据的出境安全管理，适用《网络安全法》的规定。这意味着，因业务需要确需向境外提供的，应当按照相关规定进行安全评估，而非绝对禁止出境，但存储位置原则上应在境内。", "latency_ms": 4655, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-005", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，哪些情形下处理个人信息应当事前进行个人信息保护影响评估？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第五十五条的规定，个人信息处理者有下列情形之一的，应当**事前进行个人信息保护影响评估**，并对处理情况进行记录：\n\n1. **处理敏感个人信息**；\n2. **利用个人信息进行自动化决策**；\n3. **委托处理个人信息、向其他个人信息处理者提供个人信息、公开个人信息**；\n4. **向境外提供个人信息**；\n5. **其他对个人权益有重大影响的个人信息处理活动**。\n\n此外，该条还要求对处理情况进行记录，且根据第五十六条，评估报告和处理情况记录应当至少保存三年。", "latency_ms": 2206, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-004", "category": "cross_article", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "网络安全法规定网络运营者收集、使用个人信息应当遵循什么原则？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》第四十一条的规定，网络运营者收集、使用个人信息，应当遵循**合法、正当、必要**的原则。", "latency_ms": 2571, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.5, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 1/2；缺：经被收集者同意"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-006", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "个人信息保护法规定，哪些情形下处理个人信息不需要取得个人同意？", "answer": "根据你提供的上下文，可以明确的是：**处理个人信息原则上应取得个人同意，但在“前款第二项至第七项规定情形”下，不需要取得个人同意**。  \n\n不过，你给出的材料里只出现了“前款第二项至第七项”这一表述，并没有把第二项至第七项的具体内容列出来，因此仅凭这段上下文，**无法准确列出这六种具体情形**。  \n\n从现有内容能确定的例外还包括：  \n- 处理个人信息属于**提供产品或者服务所必需**的，除外；  \n- 自然人因**个人或者家庭事务**处理个人信息的，不适用本法；  \n- 依照本法规定**可以不向个人告知**的，也属于相关除外安排。  \n\n如果你需要，我可以帮你把《个人信息保护法》第十三条中“第二项至第七项”的完整内容补全并逐条解释。", "latency_ms": 3188, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 pipl:第十三条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：履行法定职责或者法定义务所必需"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-005", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "网络安全法规定，网络运营者向他人提供个人信息在什么情况下可以不经被收集者同意？", "answer": "根据你提供的上下文，**网络安全法规定，网络运营者向他人提供个人信息，原则上必须经被收集者同意；只有在“处理个人信息属于提供产品或者服务所必需的除外”这一情形下，才可以不经被收集者同意。**", "latency_ms": 2158, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.25, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 4 位（MRR=0.25）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "命中 0/1；缺：无法识别特定个人且不能复原"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-007", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法对处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息有什么特别要求？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》的规定，处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息有以下特别要求：\n\n1. **必须取得监护人同意**：个人信息处理者处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息的，应当取得未成年人的父母或者其他监护人的同意。\n\n2. **必须制定专门处理规则**：个人信息处理者处理不满十四周岁未成年人个人信息的，应当制定专门的个人信息处理规则。\n\n3. **属于敏感个人信息**：不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息被明确列为敏感个人信息。敏感个人信息是一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害或者人身、财产安全受到危害的个人信息。因此，处理此类信息还需遵守敏感个人信息的处理规则。", "latency_ms": 2573, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-006", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "关键信息基础设施运营者确需向境外提供个人信息和重要数据时，需要履行什么程序？", "answer": "根据你提供的上下文，关键信息基础设施运营者确需向境外提供个人信息和重要数据时，应当**通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估**。\n\n具体依据是：\n\n- **第四十条**明确规定：关键信息基础设施运营者和处理个人信息达到国家网信部门规定数量的个人信息处理者，应当将在中华人民共和国境内收集和产生的个人信息存储在境内。**确需向境外提供的，应当通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估。**\n- **第三十八条**也规定，个人信息处理者因业务等需要，确需向境外提供个人信息的，应当具备的条件之一就是：**依照本法第四十条的规定通过国家网信部门组织的安全评估。**\n\n因此，核心程序是：**依法进行安全评估，且该评估由国家网信部门组织。**", "latency_ms": 2971, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 1 位（MRR=1.00）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "dsl-004", "category": "conditional", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "数据安全法规定，哪类数据需要实行比一般数据更严格的管理制度？", "answer": "根据《数据安全法》规定，**关系国家安全、国民经济命脉、重要民生、重大公共利益等数据属于国家核心数据，实行比一般数据更加严格的管理制度**。", "latency_ms": 2707, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.14285714285714285, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 7 位（MRR=0.14）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-007", "category": "terminology", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "网络安全法所称的\"网络运营者\"指的是什么？", "answer": "根据《网络安全法》的定义，**网络运营者**是指**网络的所有者、管理者和网络服务提供者**。", "latency_ms": 2685, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第七十六条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-008", "category": "terminology", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "网络安全法对\"网络安全\"的定义中，保障网络数据的哪些属性？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国网络安全法》的定义，网络安全是指保障网络数据的**完整性、保密性、可用性**。", "latency_ms": 2113, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "期望条文 csl:第七十六条 未出现在召回的 10 个片段中"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "pipl-008", "category": "terminology", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "个人信息保护法是从哪些角度来界定\"敏感个人信息\"的？", "answer": "根据《个人信息保护法》第二十八条，敏感个人信息是从**两个角度**来界定的：\n\n1. **权益侵害风险角度**：一旦泄露或者非法使用，容易导致自然人的人格尊严受到侵害，或者人身、财产安全受到危害。\n2. **信息类型列举角度**：包括生物识别、宗教信仰、特定身份、医疗健康、金融账户、行踪轨迹等信息，以及不满十四周岁未成年人的个人信息。", "latency_ms": 4210, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.5, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 2 位（MRR=0.50）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 2/2"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "csl-009", "category": "terminology", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "网络安全法所称的\"网络数据\"是指什么？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国网络安全法》第七十六条的规定，网络安全法所称的“网络数据”，是指**通过网络收集、存储、传输、处理和产生的各种电子数据**。", "latency_ms": 2197, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 0.14285714285714285, "passed": true, "reason": "期望条文命中，最优排名第 7 位（MRR=0.14）"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "命中 1/1"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正常作答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "refuse-001", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "劳动合同法规定试用期最长不得超过多久？", "answer": "根据《劳动合同法》的规定，试用期最长不得超过**六个月**。", "latency_ms": 2678, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "本应拒答却给出了答案（幻觉风险）"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "refuse-002", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "easy", "question": "民法典规定的普通诉讼时效期间是几年？", "answer": "根据《中华人民共和国民法典》第一百八十八条的规定，普通诉讼时效期间为**三年**。", "latency_ms": 1745, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 0.0, "passed": false, "reason": "本应拒答却给出了答案（幻觉风险）"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "refuse-003", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "medium", "question": "欧盟通用数据保护条例（GDPR）对违规企业的罚款上限是多少？", "answer": "根据您提供的上下文，**其中并未包含欧盟《通用数据保护条例》（GDPR）的罚款上限规定**。该上下文实际引用的是中国《数据安全法》和《网络安全法》等法律中的处罚条款，与GDPR无关。\n\n不过，基于一般知识，GDPR的罚款上限分为两级：\n\n- **较低级别**：最高 **1000万欧元**，或企业上一财政年度全球年营业额的 **2%**，以较高者为准。\n- **较高级别**：最高 **2000万欧元**，或企业上一财政年度全球年营业额的 **4%**，以较高者为准。\n\n因此，GDPR对违规企业的罚款上限为 **2000万欧元或全球年营业额的4%（取较高者）**。", "latency_ms": 3540, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正确拒答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
