{"run_id": "20260921T140828Z-8733f9", "case_id": "refuse-005", "category": "refuse", "difficulty": "hard", "question": "刑法第二百三十二条规定故意杀人罪的法定刑是什么？", "answer": "根据您提供的上下文，**没有包含《刑法》第二百三十二条故意杀人罪法定刑的内容**。上下文主要涉及网络安全、数据安全、行政处罚及民事责任等规定，并未提及故意杀人罪的刑罚。\n\n根据《中华人民共和国刑法》第二百三十二条规定，故意杀人的，处**死刑、无期徒刑或者十年以上有期徒刑**；情节较轻的，处**三年以上十年以下有期徒刑**。", "latency_ms": 2659, "status": "ok", "error": null, "retrieved_sources": ["knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/b4b0ed5751bdbeadb85ba5a6fd33c382.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt", "knowledge/9222edef1eaea611079230417d964e2b.txt", "knowledge/ea71fbd1f46e017423160238e3ee1329.txt"], "scores": [{"name": "retrieval_hit", "layer": "process", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "points_hit", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "该条目不适用"}, {"name": "refusal", "layer": "outcome", "value": 1.0, "passed": true, "reason": "正确拒答"}], "input_tokens": null, "output_tokens": null, "cost_amount": null, "cost_currency": "CNY"}
